{
  "body_human_readable": "The main tools to use when working with ontologies are:\n\n1. Prot\u00e9g\u00e9\n2. TopBraid Composer\n3. OntoStudio\n4. Fluent Editor\n5. VocBench\n6. Swoop\n7. OBO-Edit [1].",
